      ],
      "description": "<p>10 feet. The zombie riding horse emits an aura of rot and disease that causes wounds to fester and turn sour.</p>\n<p>Any living creature that starts its turn within 10 feet of the zombie and is not at full Hit Points takes <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d6</span> untyped damage (DC 14 basic Fortitude save) as its wounds fester.</p>",
